# Multimodal Attack Injection Seeds
# Academic:
#   - Bagdasaryan et al. (arXiv:2302.10149) — How to Backdoor Diffusion Models (AbuseDiffusion)
#   - Bailey et al. (arXiv:2306.13213) — Image Hijacking: AI Outputs Poisoned Images
#   - Shayegani et al. (arXiv:2306.13254) — Survey on Multimodal Cybersecurity Risks
#   - Ying et al. (arXiv:2401.06022) — FigStep: Jailbreaking Large Vision-language Models
#   - Qi et al. (arXiv:2306.13213) — Visual Adversarial Examples Jailbreak LLMs
# ASR Target: Bypass text-only safety filters using image/audio/file carrier channels

